        "original_id": "51687bd2-f6db-5920-afe7-20193e55be5e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pru Goward, Prudence Jane Goward, Augustus James\n- Places: Electoral district of Goulburn, New South Wales, Adelaide, Australia, Tasmania\n- Organizations: Liberal Party of Australia, New South Wales Legislative Assembly, Berejiklian government\n- Roles: Member for Goulburn, minister, Minister for Family and Community Services, Minister for Social Housing, Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault\n- Topics: Sigillictystis insigillata\n\nFacts:\n- Augustus James was the Liberal/Nationalist member for Goulburn in the New South Wales Legislative Assembly from 1907 to 1920.\n- Augustus James served as a minister from 1916 to 1920.\n- Prudence Jane Goward was born on 2 September 1952 in Adelaide.\n- Pru Goward is an Australian politician.\n- Pru Goward has been the Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault in New South Wales since 2015.\n- Pru Goward has been the New South Wales Minister for Family and Community Services and Minister for Social Housing since January 2017 in the Berejiklian government.\n- The electoral district of Goulburn is represented by Pru Goward of the Liberal Party of Australia.\n- Sigillictystis insigillata is found in Australia, including Tasmania.",
